# Baseline B-07 (negotiation-7): the range 5.8 down to 5.0 (00 08 08 05)
# covers spoken 5.4 and, first in client order, decides the reply
# (ADR-0484 decision 2): 00 00 04 05, and the connection then serves a
# session at 5.4: a 5.x HELLO — user_agent plus the mandatory bolt_agent
# map, its auth fields ignored (ADR-0484 decision 3) — succeeds. The
# leading C: <RAW> is the script's own handshake, so there is no
# automatic one and no !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 08 08 05 00 02 04 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 05
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "bolt_agent": {"product": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0"}}
S: SUCCESS {}
